<title>USA: Circon responds to US Surgical.</title>
<headline>Circon responds to US Surgical.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA BARBARA, Calif. 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Circon Corp on Friday reiterated its strong recommendation that its stockholders not sell their shares in a $18-a-share tender offer by U.S. Surgical.</p>
<p>The statement was made in response to U.S. Surgical Corp's extension of its unsolicited offer, which had been scheduled to expire on August 29.</p>
<p>&quot;We firmly believe that execution of our strategic plan will generate superior value for our stockholders,&quot; Richard Auhll, Circon president and chief executive officer, said in a statement.</p>
</text>
